#7850
The Chamber~
This chamber is round and seems immensely larger than the mountain
could possibly encompass. Built entirely of white marble, there are
no columns, no support beams. The room soars upwards, hundreds of
feet to form a dome, where a beautiful mosaic has been inlaid.
~
